{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "tft_alune": {
        "attack": "【附加包】甩出螺旋月环造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>，月环飞回她手里，回程路上的敌人受到<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>物理伤害。<#ff9028ff>月相<>：每放一次技能月亮长一档（最多<#ffb900ff>3<>档），大招每档+<#ffb900ff>20%<>。",
        "skill": "【附加包】月光碎片落在离她最近的<#ffb900ff>3<>个敌人身上，每枚造成<#a974ffff>42<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>32%<>魔法伤害，并使魔抗降低<#ffb900ff>20%<>，持续<#ffb900ff>6秒<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】月光洒在她和身边的友方英雄身上，攻击速度提高<#ffb900ff>36%<>，持续<#ffb900ff>5秒<>。",
        "ult": "【附加包】满月砸在敌方英雄身上，<#a974ffff>165<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>72%<>魔法伤害（每档月相+20%）由范围内的敌人分摊，只砸中一个人时为<#ffb900ff>180%<>；中心的敌人<#ef5350ff>眩晕<><#ffb900ff>0.83秒<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "tft_alune": {
        "attack": "【附加包】甩出螺旋月環造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<><#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>，月環飛回她手裡，回程路上的敵人受到<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>物理傷害。<#ff9028ff>月相<>：每施放一次技能月亮長一階（最多<#ffb900ff>3<>階），大招每階+<#ffb900ff>20%<>。",
        "skill": "【附加包】月華碎片落在離她最近的<#ffb900ff>3<>名敵人身上，每塊造成<#a974ffff>42<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>32%<>魔法傷害，並使魔抗降低<#ffb900ff>20%<>，持續<#ffb900ff>6秒<>。",
        "skill2": "【附加包】月光灑在她和身邊的友方英雄身上，攻擊速度提高<#ffb900ff>36%<>，持續<#ffb900ff>5秒<>。",
        "ult": "【附加包】滿月砸在敵方英雄身上，<#a974ffff>165<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>72%<>魔法傷害（每階月相+20%）由範圍內的敵人平均分攤，只砸中一人時為<#ffb900ff>180%<>；中心的敵人<#ef5350ff>暈眩<><#ffb900ff>0.83秒<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "tft_alune": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] Flings her spiral ring for <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>; it flies back to her, dealing <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<> physical damage to enemies on the way. <#ff9028ff>Moon Phase<>: each skill grows the moon a phase (up to <#ffb900ff>3<>); her ultimate deals <#ffb900ff>20%<> more a phase.",
        "skill": "[Add-on] Moonshards rain on the <#ffb900ff>3<> nearest enemies, each dealing <#a974ffff>42<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>32%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> and lowering magic resistance by <#ffb900ff>20%<> for <#ffb900ff>6s<>.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Moonlight falls on her and the allied champions near her: <#ffb900ff>36%<> attack speed for <#ffb900ff>5s<>.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] The full moon crashes on an enemy champion: <#a974ffff>165<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>72%<> <#a974ffff>magic damage<> (20% more a moon phase) split among the enemies in the area, <#ffb900ff>180%<> if it hits only one; those in the middle are <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>0.83s<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "tft_alune": {
        "attack": "[확장] 나선 고리를 던져 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> 물리 피해, 고리는 되돌아오며 길 위의 적에게 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<> 물리 피해. <#ff9028ff>달의 위상<>: 스킬마다 달이 한 단계 차오른다(최대 <#ffb900ff>3<>), 궁극기는 단계마다 +<#ffb900ff>20%<>.",
        "skill": "[확장] 가장 가까운 적 <#ffb900ff>3<>명에게 달조각이 떨어져 각각 <#a974ffff>42<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>32%<> 마법 피해와 <#ffb900ff>6초<> 동안 마법 저항력 -<#ffb900ff>20%<>.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 자신과 주변 아군 챔피언에게 달빛이 내려 <#ffb900ff>5초<> 동안 공격 속도 +<#ffb900ff>36%<>.",
        "ult": "[확장] 보름달이 적 챔피언에게 떨어진다: <#a974ffff>165<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>72%<> 마법 피해(위상마다 +20%)를 범위의 적이 나누어 받고, 하나만 맞으면 <#ffb900ff>180%<>; 중심의 적은 <#ffb900ff>0.83초<> <#ef5350ff>기절<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "tft_alune": {
        "attack": "【拡張】螺旋の輪を投げて<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>の物理ダメージ、輪は戻ってきて途中の敵に<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>30%<>の物理ダメージ。<#ff9028ff>月相<>：スキルごとに月が満ちる（最大<#ffb900ff>3<>段階）、アルティメットは1段階ごとに+<#ffb900ff>20%<>。",
        "skill": "【拡張】最も近い敵<#ffb900ff>3<>体に月の破片が降り、それぞれ<#a974ffff>42<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>32%<>の魔法ダメージと<#ffb900ff>6秒<>の魔法防御-<#ffb900ff>20%<>。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】自分と周りの味方チャンピオンに月光が降り、<#ffb900ff>5秒<>間攻撃速度+<#ffb900ff>36%<>。",
        "ult": "【拡張】満月が敵チャンピオンに落ちる：<#a974ffff>165<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ap_0><#a974ffff>72%<>の魔法ダメージ（月相1段階ごとに+20%）を範囲の敵で分け合い、1体だけなら<#ffb900ff>180%<>；中心の敵は<#ffb900ff>0.83秒<><#ef5350ff>スタン<>。"
      }
    }
  }
}
